<p>Fire out an orb of light that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">83, 112, 135, 154, 171</acronym> light damage and then returns, dealing the same amount of damage again and reducing the cooldown by half (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 5, 4, 4, 4</acronym>) when it reaches you. The damage will increase with your spellpower. The ball will travel at most 28 distance to return to you.</p>